      "answer_read_via_turn": 46217.0,
      "first_playback_start": 12869.0
     },
     "segments": [
      {
       "index": 1,
       "chars": 126,
       "text": "My lord, the delay you observe is largely a function of the local processing chain that turns your spoken words into my voice.",
       "duration_s": 7.36,
       "arrived_ms": 12869.0,
       "playback_start_ms": 12869.0,
       "waited_for_previous_ms": 0.0,
       "gap_after_previous_ms": null,
       "text_offset_before_ms": 33348.0,
       "text_offset_after_ms": 998.9
      },
      {
       "index": 2,
       "chars": 115,
       "text": "The system first recognises speech, then the model reasons and writes, and finally a synthesiser renders the words.",
       "duration_s": 7.68,
       "arrived_ms": 16367.7,
       "playback_start_ms": 20229.0,
       "waited_for_previous_ms": 3861.4,
       "gap_after_previous_ms": 0.0,
       "text_offset_before_ms": 25988.0,
       "text_offset_after_ms": 0.0
      },
      {
       "index": 3,
       "chars": 50,
       "text": "Each of those stages takes a fixed amount of time;",
       "duration_s": 2.88,
       "arrived_ms": 18043.3,
       "playback_start_ms": 27909.0,
       "waited_for_previous_ms": 9865.8,
       "gap_after_previous_ms": 0.0,
       "text_offset_before_ms": 18308.0,
       "text_offset_after_ms": 0.0
      },
      {
       "index": 4,
       "chars": 46,
       "text": "none of it can be shortened by software alone.",
       "duration_s": 2.72,
       "arrived_ms": 19716.8,
       "playback_start_ms": 30789.0,
       "waited_for_previous_ms": 11072.2,
       "gap_after_previous_ms": 0.0,
       "text_offset_before_ms": 15428.0,
       "text_offset_after_ms": 0.0
      },
      {
       "index": 5,
       "chars": 86,
       "text": "If you wish to shave a few hundred milliseconds off the total, consider the following:",
       "duration_s": 4.8,
       "arrived_ms": 21878.2,
       "playback_start_ms": 33509.0,
       "waited_for_previous_ms": 11630.8,
       "gap_after_previous_ms": 0.0,
       "text_offset_before_ms": 12708.0,
       "text_offset_after_ms": 0.0
      },
      {
       "index": 6,
       "chars": 141,
       "text": "1. **Hardware** \u2013 A faster CPU or a more recent graphics processor can reduce the time spent in the language model and the voice synthesiser.",
       "duration_s": 8.64,
       "arrived_ms": 25237.6,
       "playback_start_ms": 38309.0,
       "waited_for_previous_ms": 13071.4,
       "gap_after_previous_ms": 0.0,
       "text_offset_before_ms": 7908.0,
       "text_offset_after_ms": 0.0
      },
      {
       "index": 7,
       "chars": 120,
       "text": "2. **Audio capture** \u2013 Use a microphone with low\u2011latency drivers and avoid any pre\u2011processing that introduces buffering.",
       "duration_s": 7.52,
       "arrived_ms": 28334.6,
       "playback_start_ms": 46949.0,
       "waited_for_previous_ms": 18614.5,
       "gap_after_previous_ms": 0.0,
       "text_offset_before_ms": -732.0,
       "text_offset_after_ms": 0.0
      },
      {
       "index": 8,
       "chars": 52,
       "text": "3. **Prompt size** \u2013 Keep the spoken prompt concise;",
       "duration_s": 4.08,
       "arrived_ms": 30351.3,
       "playback_start_ms": 54469.0,
       "waited_for_previous_ms": 24117.7,
       "gap_after_previous_ms": 0.0,
       "text_offset_before_ms": -8252.0,
       "text_offset_after_ms": 0.0
      },
      {
       "index": 9,
       "chars": 51,
       "text": "each additional word adds a line of inference time.",
       "duration_s": 3.28,
       "arrived_ms": 32105.4,
       "playback_start_ms": 58549.0,
       "waited_for_previous_ms": 26443.6,
       "gap_after_previous_ms": 0.0,
       "text_offset_before_ms": -12332.0,
       "text_offset_after_ms": 0.0
      },
      {
       "index": 10,
       "chars": 128,
       "text": "4. **Simplify the task** \u2013 If you only need a brief answer, phrase it as a direct question rather than a multi\u2011sentence request.",
       "duration_s": 8.16,
       "arrived_ms": 35353.8,
       "playback_start_ms": 61829.0,
       "waited_for_previous_ms": 26475.3,
       "gap_after_previous_ms": 0.0,
       "text_offset_before_ms": -15612.0,
       "text_offset_after_ms": 0.0
      },
      {
       "index": 11,
       "chars": 93,
       "text": "5. **Local resources** \u2013 Ensure that no background processes are competing for CPU or memory.",
       "duration_s": 7.12,
       "arrived_ms": 38274.5,
       "playback_start_ms": 69989.0,
       "waited_for_previous_ms": 31714.5,
       "gap_after_previous_ms": 0.0,
       "text_offset_before_ms": -23772.0,
       "text_offset_after_ms": 0.0
      },
      {
       "index": 12,
       "chars": 173,
       "text": "These adjustments can bring the total from roughly 6\u201313\u202fseconds down toward a single second, but they do not change the inherent limits of the current model and synthesiser.",
       "duration_s": 9.68,
       "arrived_ms": 42039.3,
       "playback_start_ms": 77109.0,
       "waited_for_previous_ms": 35069.7,
       "gap_after_previous_ms": 0.0,
       "text_offset_before_ms": -30892.0,
       "text_offset_after_ms": 0.0
      },
      {
       "index": 13,
       "chars": 84,
       "text": "I cannot measure the exact time for this turn, nor can I guarantee a precise figure;",
       "duration_s": 4.32,
       "arrived_ms": 44114.6,
       "playback_start_ms": 86789.0,
       "waited_for_previous_ms": 42674.4,
       "gap_after_previous_ms": 0.0,
       "text_offset_before_ms": -40572.0,
       "text_offset_after_ms": 0.0
      },
      {
       "index": 14,
       "chars": 55,
       "text": "I can only tell you what factors influence the latency.",
       "duration_s": 3.76,
       "arrived_ms": 46024.4,
       "playback_start_ms": 91109.0,
       "waited_for_previous_ms": 45084.6,
       "gap_after_previous_ms": 0.0,
       "text_offset_before_ms": -44892.0,
       "text_offset_after_ms": 0.0
      }
     ]
    }
