      "turn_appended": 80984.8,
      "answer_read_via_turn": 81008.1,
      "first_playback_start": 13646.7
     },
     "segments": [
      {
       "index": 1,
       "chars": 136,
       "text": "My lord, the delay you feel arises from a chain of steps that cannot be shortened beyond the limits of the hardware and software in use.",
       "duration_s": 6.64,
       "arrived_ms": 13646.7,
       "playback_start_ms": 13646.7,
       "waited_for_previous_ms": 0.0,
       "gap_after_previous_ms": null,
       "text_offset_before_ms": 67361.5,
       "text_offset_after_ms": 8315.8
      },
      {
       "index": 2,
       "chars": 103,
       "text": "To bring the total from the present 6\u201313\u202fseconds toward a single\u2011second window, consider the following:",
       "duration_s": 6.56,
       "arrived_ms": 18409.0,
       "playback_start_ms": 20286.7,
       "waited_for_previous_ms": 1877.7,
       "gap_after_previous_ms": 0.0,
       "text_offset_before_ms": 60721.5,
       "text_offset_after_ms": 1675.8
      },
      {
       "index": 3,
       "chars": 242,
       "text": "| Step | Typical latency | What can be altered on your side |\n|------|-----------------|----------------------------------|\n| **Speech recognition** | 1\u20132\u202fs (Whisper model inference) | \u2022 Use a lighter\u2011weight recogniser if latency is critical.",
       "duration_s": 17.2,
       "arrived_ms": 27444.2,
       "playback_start_ms": 27444.2,
       "waited_for_previous_ms": 0.0,
       "gap_after_previous_ms": 597.5,
       "text_offset_before_ms": 53563.9,
       "text_offset_after_ms": 0.0
      },
      {
       "index": 4,
       "chars": 85,
       "text": "<br>\u2022 Ensure the microphone input is clear, at 16\u202fkHz, with minimal background noise.",
       "duration_s": 5.76,
       "arrived_ms": 30027.7,
       "playback_start_ms": 44644.2,
       "waited_for_previous_ms": 14616.5,
       "gap_after_previous_ms": 0.0,
       "text_offset_before_ms": 36363.9,
       "text_offset_after_ms": 0.0
      },
      {
       "index": 5,
       "chars": 136,
       "text": "|\n| **Model inference** | 3\u20136\u202fs (local LLM reasoning) | \u2022 Run the model on a faster CPU or, if available, on a GPU with sufficient VRAM.",
       "duration_s": 10.88,
       "arrived_ms": 34057.4,
       "playback_start_ms": 50404.2,
       "waited_for_previous_ms": 16346.8,
       "gap_after_previous_ms": 0.0,
       "text_offset_before_ms": 30603.9,
       "text_offset_after_ms": 0.0
      },
      {
       "index": 6,
       "chars": 102,
       "text": "<br>\u2022 Reduce model size (e.g., 6\u2011billion parameter variant) if you must trade some accuracy for speed.",
       "duration_s": 6.8,
       "arrived_ms": 36870.6,
       "playback_start_ms": 61284.2,
       "waited_for_previous_ms": 24413.6,
       "gap_after_previous_ms": 0.0,
       "text_offset_before_ms": 19723.9,
       "text_offset_after_ms": 0.0
      },
      {
       "index": 7,
       "chars": 147,
       "text": "|\n| **Text\u2011to\u2011speech** | 1\u20133\u202fs (local TTS engine) | \u2022 Switch to a lower\u2011latency TTS voice or use a pre\u2011generated speech cache for frequent phrases.",
       "duration_s": 10.64,
       "arrived_ms": 40897.3,
       "playback_start_ms": 68084.2,
       "waited_for_previous_ms": 27186.8,
       "gap_after_previous_ms": 0.0,
       "text_offset_before_ms": 12923.9,
       "text_offset_after_ms": 0.0
      },
      {
       "index": 8,
       "chars": 84,
       "text": "<br>\u2022 Keep the TTS engine running persistently rather than launching it per request.",
       "duration_s": 4.4,
       "arrived_ms": 42987.7,
       "playback_start_ms": 78724.2,
       "waited_for_previous_ms": 35736.5,
       "gap_after_previous_ms": 0.0,
       "text_offset_before_ms": 2283.9,
       "text_offset_after_ms": 0.0
      },
      {
       "index": 9,
       "chars": 97,
       "text": "|\n| **System overhead** | 0\u20131\u202fs (OS scheduling, disk I/O) | \u2022 Close other demanding applications.",
       "duration_s": 7.52,
       "arrived_ms": 45990.3,
       "playback_start_ms": 83124.2,
       "waited_for_previous_ms": 37133.9,
       "gap_after_previous_ms": 0.0,
       "text_offset_before_ms": -2116.1,
       "text_offset_after_ms": 0.0
      },
      {
       "index": 10,
       "chars": 51,
       "text": "<br>\u2022 Allocate more RAM to the process if possible.",
       "duration_s": 2.56,
       "arrived_ms": 47576.6,
       "playback_start_ms": 90644.2,
       "waited_for_previous_ms": 43067.5,
       "gap_after_previous_ms": 0.0,
       "text_offset_before_ms": -9636.1,
       "text_offset_after_ms": 0.0
      },
      {
       "index": 11,
       "chars": 51,
       "text": "|\n\n### Practical steps you can take immediately\n\n1.",
       "duration_s": 3.36,
       "arrived_ms": 49340.5,
       "playback_start_ms": 93204.2,
       "waited_for_previous_ms": 43863.7,
       "gap_after_previous_ms": 0.0,
       "text_offset_before_ms": -12196.1,
       "text_offset_after_ms": 0.0
      },
      {
       "index": 12,
       "chars": 111,
       "text": "**Check your microphone quality** \u2013 a condenser mic at 44\u202fkHz gives cleaner input and reduces recognition time.",
       "duration_s": 6.56,
       "arrived_ms": 52095.1,
       "playback_start_ms": 96564.2,
       "waited_for_previous_ms": 44469.1,
       "gap_after_previous_ms": 0.0,
       "text_offset_before_ms": -15556.1,
       "text_offset_after_ms": 0.0
      },
      {
       "index": 13,
       "chars": 111,
       "text": "2. **Maintain a quiet environment** \u2013 background noise forces the recogniser to spend more time disambiguating.",
       "duration_s": 6.72,
       "arrived_ms": 54869.6,
       "playback_start_ms": 103124.2,
       "waited_for_previous_ms": 48254.6,
       "gap_after_previous_ms": 0.0,
       "text_offset_before_ms": -22116.1,
       "text_offset_after_ms": 0.0
      },
      {
       "index": 14,
       "chars": 93,
       "text": "3. **Keep the application running** \u2013 a cold start (loading models, TTS engine) adds seconds.",
       "duration_s": 6.88,
       "arrived_ms": 57691.4,
       "playback_start_ms": 109844.2,
       "waited_for_previous_ms": 52152.8,
       "gap_after_previous_ms": 0.0,
       "text_offset_before_ms": -28836.1,
       "text_offset_after_ms": 0.0
      },
      {
       "index": 15,
       "chars": 95,
       "text": "4. **Allocate dedicated CPU cores** \u2013 if the system allows, reserve a core for the LLM process.",
       "duration_s": 7.12,
       "arrived_ms": 60623.6,
       "playback_start_ms": 116724.2,
       "waited_for_previous_ms": 56100.6,
       "gap_after_previous_ms": 0.0,
       "text_offset_before_ms": -35716.1,
       "text_offset_after_ms": 0.0
      },
      {
       "index": 16,
       "chars": 198,
       "text": "5. **Consider a smaller model** \u2013 if the current 13\u2011billion parameter variant is in use, moving to a 6\u2011billion or 3\u2011billion variant can cut inference time by roughly half, at the cost of some depth.",
       "duration_s": 11.44,
       "arrived_ms": 65125.6,
       "playback_start_ms": 123844.2,
       "waited_for_previous_ms": 58718.6,
       "gap_after_previous_ms": 0.0,
       "text_offset_before_ms": -42836.1,
       "text_offset_after_ms": 0.0
      },
      {
       "index": 17,
       "chars": 72,
       "text": "6. **Update the TTS voice** \u2013 newer voices are often compiled for speed;",
       "duration_s": 5.28,
       "arrived_ms": 67544.2,
       "playback_start_ms": 135284.2,
       "waited_for_previous_ms": 67740.0,
       "gap_after_previous_ms": 0.0,
       "text_offset_before_ms": -54276.1,
       "text_offset_after_ms": 0.0
      },
      {
       "index": 18,
       "chars": 42,
       "text": "ensure you have the latest engine version.",
       "duration_s": 2.24,
       "arrived_ms": 69042.9,
       "playback_start_ms": 140564.2,
       "waited_for_previous_ms": 71521.3,
       "gap_after_previous_ms": 0.0,
       "text_offset_before_ms": -59556.1,
       "text_offset_after_ms": 0.0
      },
      {
       "index": 19,
       "chars": 114,
       "text": "### What we cannot change\n\n- The fundamental inference time of the model on your current hardware is a hard limit;",
       "duration_s": 6.32,
       "arrived_ms": 71810.9,
       "playback_start_ms": 142804.2,
